FORM S-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: statutes-of-delegation.

OFF THE RECORD: Generic map, filter, and fold operations. Each office
OFF THE RECORD: accepts a power of attorney as an argument. Earlier
OFF THE RECORD: canon versions needed concrete folds because offices
OFF THE RECORD: could not be passed as values. Powers of attorney now
OFF THE RECORD: provide that capability, so these operations can be
OFF THE RECORD: defined once.
OFF THE RECORD:
OFF THE RECORD: applied-to-each and selected-by require a one-argument
OFF THE RECORD: office. folded-with requires two arguments: the
OFF THE RECORD: accumulated value and the current item. An arity
OFF THE RECORD: mismatch produces a verdict when the power is used.

THE OFFICE OF applied-to-each, CONCERNING counsel AND entries.
    REMAND WITH THE FINDING OF applied-from REGARDING counsel AND entries AND 1 AND AN EMPTY SCHEDULE.

THE OFFICE OF applied-from, CONCERNING counsel AND entries AND index AND accumulated.
    SHOULD index EXCEED THE LENGTH OF entries, REMAND WITH accumulated.
    ANNEX THE FINDING UNDER counsel REGARDING THE ITEM AT index IN entries TO accumulated.
    REMAND WITH THE FINDING OF applied-from REGARDING counsel AND entries AND index PLUS 1 AND accumulated.

THE OFFICE OF selected-by, CONCERNING counsel AND entries.
    REMAND WITH THE FINDING OF selected-from REGARDING counsel AND entries AND 1 AND AN EMPTY SCHEDULE.

THE OFFICE OF selected-from, CONCERNING counsel AND entries AND index AND accumulated.
    SHOULD index EXCEED THE LENGTH OF entries, REMAND WITH accumulated.
    SHOULD THE FINDING UNDER counsel REGARDING THE ITEM AT index IN entries EQUAL SUSTAINED, ANNEX THE ITEM AT index IN entries TO accumulated.
    REMAND WITH THE FINDING OF selected-from REGARDING counsel AND entries AND index PLUS 1 AND accumulated.

THE OFFICE OF folded-with, CONCERNING counsel AND entries AND opening.
    REMAND WITH THE FINDING OF folded-from REGARDING counsel AND entries AND 1 AND opening.

THE OFFICE OF folded-from, CONCERNING counsel AND entries AND index AND accumulated.
    SHOULD index EXCEED THE LENGTH OF entries, REMAND WITH accumulated.
    REMAND WITH THE FINDING OF folded-from REGARDING counsel AND entries AND index PLUS 1 AND (THE FINDING UNDER counsel REGARDING accumulated AND (THE ITEM AT index IN entries)).
